15 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Flowchart graphic with four colored horizontal arrows showing hierarchy in artificial intelligence fields: AI at the top in orange, ML in green, DL in turquoise, and AI-Assisted PDD/PDT in blue, each with brief descriptions of their major functions and roles.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Flowchart and illustrated infographic showing how artificial intelligence \(AI\) improves photodynamic diagnosis and therapy by supporting clinicians, reducing errors, advancing imaging, and optimizing light exposure, leading to better patient outcomes through AI-enabled photosensitizer distribution, multispectral diagnosis, and real-time treatment adjustment.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Infographic illustrating an AI medical imaging system workflow, including multimodal inputs like autofluorescence and ultrasound, AI analysis by a specialist, outputs such as lesion recognition and diagnosis, and challenges like talent shortages and inspection standards.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 50 0 R /Alt (Infographic outlining a photodynamic therapy workflow, showing treatment steps from administration, accumulation, light activation, and cellular response to dosimetry and monitoring, including AI optimization, oxygen and ROS monitoring, and real-time data analysis, leading to outcome assessment through AI predictions and therapeutic evaluation, with challenges listed at the bottom.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 51 0 R /Alt (Infographic outlining challenges for AI-PDD/PDT including small database, model interpretability, ethical concerns, and robotic integration, each illustrated with examples like data scarcity, algorithmic bias, informed consent, and robotic precision. A clinical translation roadmap is shown below, detailing five phases: fundamental R&D, pre-clinical studies, clinical trials, regulatory approval, and real-world deployment, with milestones, critical checkpoints, and timelines from one to five years.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
